---
title: Domains
description: Resell domain names through supported registrars.
---

{% aside type="note" %}
Domain reselling in FOSSBilling is functional but has some limitations. We're working on improvements.
{% /aside %}

Use domain products when you want clients to search, register, renew, or transfer domains through a supported registrar integration.

## What Works

- Domain registration, renewal, and transfers
- WHOIS lookup for availability checks
- Support for popular registrars

## Current Limitations

| Limitation | Details |
|------------|---------|
| Static pricing | You set prices per TLD manually — FOSSBilling doesn't pull live pricing from registrars |
| Hard-coded TLDs | Available TLDs are defined in each registrar module |
| Limited registrars | Only specific registrars are supported (see below) |

## Supported Registrars

### Official Integrations

- **[Namecheap](https://www.namecheap.com/)**
- **[Netim](https://www.netim.com/)** — [View their module](https://github.com/netim-com/fossbilling-registrar-module)

### Generic/Community Options

| Option | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **Custom** | Manual process — use as last resort. Can check WHOIS for availability. |
| **Email** | Sends an email when domains are ordered. Can check WHOIS. ⚠️ Currently uses PHP `sendmail` instead of FOSSBilling's email settings. |
| **[Generic RFC EPP](https://github.com/getpinga/fossbilling-epp-rfc)** | By Pinga — for registries supporting standard EPP |
| **[FRED Registry](https://github.com/getpinga/fossbilling-epp-fred)** | By Pinga — for FRED-based registries |
| **[Hostmaster.ua](https://github.com/getpinga/fossbilling-epp-ua)** | By Pinga — for Ukrainian domains |

### Known Issues

**ResellerClub** has known bugs:
- [Issue #1267](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/issues/1267)
- [Issue #77](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/issues/77)

The module exists but needs fixes. [Source code](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/blob/main/src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Resellerclub.php)

## Setting Up Domain Reselling

1. Get API credentials from your chosen registrar
2. Go to **System** → **Domain registration** in FOSSBilling
3. Configure the registrar settings
4. Set up pricing for each TLD you want to sell
5. Enable the TLDs you want to offer
